{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1792323254809,"sessionID":"ses_eb169bc13ffeEpLd78TBieNkiy","part":{"id":"prt_14eca7a15001J0V0mDiCWuIsV8","messageID":"msg_14eca762400161JH9PwSFGaD2z","sessionID":"ses_eb169bc13ffeEpLd78TBieNkiy","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792323316273,"sessionID":"ses_eb169bc13ffeEpLd78TBieNkiy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-bd3af2488ef870a5","state":{"status":"error","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/opencode/simulation.py","newString":"def create_opamp_netlist():\n    netlist = \"\"\"* opamp_netlist.cil - Two-stage Miller-compensated CMOS op-amp\n* NMOS differential input pair + PMOS active load + PMOS CS second stage\n*\n* Bias: IREF=60uA, M6 diode-connected PMOS, mirror ratios:\n*   M7/NMOS=200u/10u (20:1 -> tail=1.2mA, but limited by model)\n*   M8/NMOS=100u/10u (10:1 -> second-stage=600uA)\n*\n* Stage 1: NMOS diff pair (M1/M2) + PMOS current mirror (M3/M4) + NMOS tail (M7)\n* Stage 2: PMOS CS (M5) + NMOS current source load (M8)\n* Compensation: Rz=100ohm, Cc=0.22pF\n\n.include \"\"\" + DATA_DIR + \"\"\"\n\n.param lch=44n\n\n.subckt opamp vdd gnd inp inn out\n\n* --- PMOS BIAS MIRROR (M6 diode-connected establishes gate voltage) ---\nIREF   iref   gnd   DC 60u\nM6   iref  iref  vdd  vdd   pmos  W=10u  L=44n  AD=3.80e-7  AS=7.60e-7  PD=1.52e-7  PS=1.004e-6\n\n* --- STAGE 1: NMOS differential pair + PMOS active load + NMOS tail current ---\n* inp -> M2 gate, inn -> M1 gate\nM1   d1    inn   tail  gnd   nmos  W=10u  L=44n  AD=3.80e-7  AS=7.60e-7  PD=1.52e-7   PS=1.004e-6\nM2   d2    inp   tail  gnd   nmos  W=10u  L=44n  AD=3.80e-7  AS=7.60e-7  PD=1.52e-7   PS=1.004e-6\n\n* PMOS current mirror active load (M3 diode-connected, M4 mirror)\nM3   g3    g3    vdd   vdd   pmos  W=20u  L=44n  AD=7.60e-7  AS=1.52e-6  PD=3.04e-7  PS=2.304e-5\nM4   d2    g3    vdd   vdd   pmos  W=20u  L=44n  AD=7.60e-7  AS=1.52e-6  PD=3.04e-7  PS=2.304e-5\n\n* NMOS tail current source (mirrors from IREF through bias network)\n* M7 mirrors IREF * (w7/w3): IREF=60uA, w7/w3=200/10=20 -> I=1.2mA\n* But we'll adjust ratios below for realistic current\nM7   tail  iref  gnd   gnd   nmos  W=200u L=44n  AD=7.60e-6 AS=1.52e-5  PD=3.04e-6  PS=2.304e-4\n\n* --- STAGE 2: PMOS common-source + NMOS current source load ---\n* d2 (stage 1 output) -> M5 gate\nM5   out   d2    vdd   vdd   pmos  W=50u  L=44n  AD=1.90e-6  AS=3.80e-6  PD=7.60e-7  PS=5.004e-5\nM8   out   iref  gnd   gnd   nmos  W=100u L=44n  AD=3.80e-6  AS=7.60e-6  PD=1.52e-6  PS=1.004e-5\n\n* --- MILLER COMPENSATION ---\nRz  d2    cc_mid  100\nCc  cc_mid out     0.22p\n\n.ends opamp\n\"\"\"\n    path = os.path.join(WORKDIR, 'opamp_netlist.cir')\n    with open(path, 'w') as f:\n        f.write(netlist)","oldString":"def create_opamp_netlist():\n    netlist = \"\"\"* opamp_netlist.cir - Two-stage Miller-compensated CMOS op-amp\n* PTM 22nm HP CMOS Op-Amp\n* Bias: IREF=60uA, w6=20u, w7=200u (tail=600uA, branch=300uA), w8=100u (2nd=300uA)\n* Total I = 960uA, P = 1.15mW < 1.484mW\n* Input pair w12=5u L=44n, mirror w34=10u, gain stage w5=80u\n* Compensation: Rz=100ohm, Cc=0.22pF\n\n.include \"\"\" + DATA_DIR + \"\"\"\n\n.param lch=44n\n\n.subckt opamp vdd gnd inp inn out\n\n* --- PMOS BIAS MIRROR ---\n* IREF sinks 60uA from diode-connected M6 to GND\n* M6 (20u) sets gate voltage for M7 (200u) and M8 (100u)\nIREF   iref   gnd   DC 60u\n\nM6  iref  iref  vdd  vdd   pmos  W=20u  L=44n  AD=7.60e-7  AS=1.52e-6  PD=3.04e-7  PS=2.304e-5\nM7  tail  iref  vdd  vdd   pmos  W=200u L=44n  AD=7.60e-6 AS=1.52e-5  PD=3.04e-6  PS=2.304e-4\nM8  out   iref  vdd  vdd   pmos  W=100u L=44n  AD=3.80e-6 AS=7.60e-6  PD=1.52e-6  PS=1.104e-4\n\n* --- STAGE 1: PMOS diff pair + NMOS active load ---\n* inn -> M1 gate, inp -> M2 gate, tail -> M7 source/drain\nM1  d1    inn   tail  vdd   pmos  W=5u  L=44n  AD=1.90e-7  AS=3.80e-7  PD=1.52e-7   PS=3.040e-6\nM2  d2    inp   tail  vdd   pmos  W=5u  L=44n  AD=1.90e-7  AS=3.80e-7  PD=1.52e-7   PS=3.040e-6\n\n* NMOS current mirror active load\nM3  d1    d1    gnd   gnd   nmos  W=10u L=44n  AD=3.80e-7  AS=7.60e-7  PD=1.52e-7   PS=1.004e-6\nM4  d2    d1    gnd   gnd   nmos  W=10u L=44n  AD=3.80e-7  AS=7.60e-7  PD=1.52e-7   PS=1.004e-6\n\n* --- STAGE 2: NMOS common-source + PMOS current source load ---\nM5  out   d2    gnd   gnd   nmos  W=80u L=44n  AD=3.04e-6  AS=6.08e-6  PD=1.216e-6  PS=4.004e-5\n\n* --- MILLER COMPENSATION ---\nRz  d2    cc_mid  100\nCc  cc_mid out     0.22p\n\n.ends opamp\n\"\"\"\n    path = os.path.join(WORKDIR, 'opamp_netlist.cir')\n    with open(path, 'w') as f:\n        f.write(netlist)"},"error":"Could not find oldString in the file. It must match exactly, including whitespace, indentation, and line endings.","time":{"start":1792323316230,"end":1792323316271}},"id":"prt_14eca7e43001o1gZmHkYYvMIXj","sessionID":"ses_eb169bc13ffeEpLd78TBieNkiy","messageID":"msg_14eca762400161JH9PwSFGaD2z"}}
